  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_finlpp",
      "name": {
        "en": "Purestream's Badge",
        "zh": "清流证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Purestream has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for wide-range healing in tandem with endowment of effects of benefit upon Operators.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Medic Operator during field operations to exercise Therapist responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员清流擅长大范围治疗并为其他干员提供增益效果\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为医疗干员，行使疗养师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_finlpp",
      "name": {
        "en": "'The River's Lingering Charm'",
        "zh": "“江河之韵”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_finlpp",
      "description": {
        "en": "So I've lost my talisman. I've been looking for ages, and I still can't find it. It was only a little thing I bought while carrying out a mission in Yan, but the local said it'd been blessed at the temple. Someone tells me I can go and ask Purestream. Purestream... I'm not too familiar with the name. Maybe it's a new operator handling lost and found at Logistics?\nIt's not in my dorm...\nOr the meeting room...\nI find her at the baths. She's just finished repair work, and now she's—well, bathing. I can even hear her singing from outside the door. It's loud, clear and perfect... but don't you feel icky bathing for that long?\n'Sorry, sorry, I know I kept you waiting.'\n'Rhodes Island's sewage work is up to the task, but they've really been overlooking cleaning the filtration system itself. The vast majority of areas have blockages. You need to get into them frequently! All I can do is hang on until the whole cleaning job's done before I... heheh.'\n'Is this your charm? Come and take a look.'\nThe girl absentmindedly talks as she opens a bag. Aside from my talisman, I can see marbles, hair clips, test tubes, and even an ammo magazine...\n'Did you... find all of these in the sewage filtration system?'\n'Yup. It was covered in mud when I found it, absolutely filthy, but I've already thoroughly cleaned it.'\nI'm about to ask 'how could it have gotten there,' but I hold it back. I should be asking myself that...\nLater, I'm chatting with a friend in Engineering about the landship breaking down and getting repaired. Nobody would've called the problem being the sewage systems. Operator Purestream took on the cleanup task all alone after only a day of her job, and she'd spent two whole days inside the filthy inner filtration system... blockages in a few specific areas were the 'main culprits,' all the 'treasures' we'd accidentally lost and couldn't find. I remember Purestream sort of shyly smiled when I told her thanks, and she just urged me to 'take care from now on,' giving me a precautions while she was at it. Water could flush everything away, so we'd gotten used to just twisting taps and pushing on valves, simple as that. It was precisely because water could flush everything that we never knew how dirty it'd gotten, somewhere out of our sights.\nI hear Purestream's in charge of Rhodes Island landship sewage work now. I didn't know what she liked, so all I could figure was to buy some scented soap and send it to her. I only found out later she'd gotten piles of it by that point. I guess I wasn't the only one who wanted to tell her thank you.\n\n—As related by an operator, extracted from a periodic evaluation of Purestream following her onboarding",
        "zh": "我的护身符丢了，找了很久都没找到。虽然只是在炎国执行任务时顺道买的小玩意，但据当地人说，是在寺庙里开过光的。有人告诉我，可以去清流那儿问问看。清流……我对这个名字没有太深的印象，难道是后勤部负责失物招领的新干员？\n不在宿舍……\n也不在会议室……\n我是在大浴场找到的她，她刚结束检修工作，当时正在——泡澡，我在门外甚至能听到她在唱歌，高音很完美……只是泡那么久不会难受吗？\n“抱歉抱歉，让你久等了。”\n“罗德岛的排污工作是合格的，但对于过滤系统本身的清洁未免也太不重视了，绝大多数区域都有积淤，需要频繁进出，我只能等到全部清理工作完成才……嘿嘿。”\n“你看看这是你的护身符吗？”\n这位小姑娘一边自顾自地说着，一边打开一个袋子，除了我的护身符，我还看到里面有弹珠、发卡、试管，甚至一个弹夹……\n“这些，都是在排污过滤系统里找到的？”\n“是啊。刚发现的时候裹了一层泥巴，很脏，但我已经认真清洗过了。”\n我刚想问“为什么会丢到那儿去”，但忍住了，这个问题似乎该问我自己……\n后来我和工程部的朋友聊起这次本舰故障检修，谁也没想到问题居然出在排污系统上，刚入职一天的清流干员独立承担了清理任务，在脏兮兮的内过滤系统里待了足足两天……个别区域堵塞的“罪魁祸首”，便是我们这些意外丢失遍寻不见的“宝贝”。我想起我此前表示感谢时清流有些羞怯的笑容，她只是叮嘱说“以后请注意”，顺便交代了一些注意事项。水能够冲走一切，所以我们习惯了扭扭龙头按按开关，很简单。也正是因为水能够冲走一切，所以我们从来不知道，看不见的地方，有多污浊。\n听说清流已经负责起了罗德岛的舰船排污工作，我不知道她喜欢什么，想来想去，只好买了块香皂送给她，后来才知道她已经收到很多块了。看来不止我一个人想到向她表示感谢。\n\n——摘自清流入职定期评估时某干员的叙述",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
